> 
> Below are the most likely fixes (you don’t need all of them—pick the one that best matches how you want the app to look):
> 
> ---
> 
> ## Option 1 – Force classic Bootstrap page instead of `page_navbar`
> 
> If you don’t strictly need `page_navbar()` and are happy with a more classic navbar layout, change the top-level UI to a standard `navbarPage` or `fluidPage`. For example:
> 
> ```r
